// What one keyword counter confers [CR#122.1b]: its bearer gains the keyword
// in layer 6 [CR#613.1f], as the ability-free `Property` flavor
// [CR#113.12]. Granting it once per counter held is having it once. The
// keyword is named by its declaration's name (`grants(flying)`), read at a
// keyword label position (ruling 2026-10-06).
(
    name: "grants",
    kinds: [Conferral],
    params: {"keyword": KeywordLabel},
    body: Property(spec: AbilityGrant(subject: This, ability: Keyword(Param(keyword), [], []))),
)
